# Club & Grub - World 8, stage 1 in co-op: "Overgrown Steps" (designer D8). The co-op file of levels/w8_l1.lvl
# (DESIGN.md A.6 / D.10, LEVEL_DESIGN.md 15.7): the same temple stair with P2's start, a pair of swirling axes at
# checkpoint 2 and two co-op gates on the main path, each with its x2 tablet and a checkpoint behind:
#  - 'hall': the low arch of terrace T1 is a keeper hall exactly 4 rows high; two Shellbacks stand still in it and
#    turn their shields to the nearer hero every tick - one hero baits them from the front while the other, dropped
#    in through the hole in the lintel behind them, clubs their backs; the keeper door opens when both are dead;
#  - 'stairs': on a dais at the end of the hall the two heroes heave the boulder onto plate A (it holds it for
#    good); one stands on plate B while the other climbs the three stair columns that rise while A and B are both
#    pressed, and holds plate C on the summit, which lifts the door of a vine shaft in the cliff: the holder's way
#    up. Everything of the gate lies within one view, the summit 9 rows over the dais (the tribe camera).
# Co-op traits: the two Shellback keepers, `lone` ruin ghosts and a temple Raptor (daze: one bounces, the other
# strikes) before the exit. Left out for the gates' role holders: the Guards (a co-op Guard needs a 4-row hall),
# the scarabs under the old arch and the ghost over terrace T1. The swirling axe comes in a pair at checkpoint 2.

