# The first feast piece lies BEHIND the keeper door of 'hall' (wf12, DESIGN G92; it lay at 51,38 on the lintel
# over the hall): a feast's touch kills a shell keeper, and a hero who came in with two pieces of the kit took
# it, dropped through the lintel's hole and opened the door alone (replayed on the real game with his partner
# idle: the far cell at tick 597). Now it lies on the plinth of plate 2 beside the two fruits, on the pair's
# way: no feast can burn in the hall, and the kit still fills at the summit (the route's Raptor dies of it).
# No feast piece between a stage's start and a shell or daze keeper door (LEVEL_DESIGN 15.7.5).
